## Directory Structure & Ownership

```
workspace/                           # May be renamed by user
|
|-- AGENTS.md                        # Quick reference (points to .claude)
|-- README.md                        # User documentation
|
|-- testprogram/                     # USER + AGENT: Test program(s)
|
+-- .claude/                         # Agent configuration & runtime
    |-- rules/                       # Protocol rules (.mdc) + workflows.md
    |-- skills/                      # Skill/tool definitions
    |-- knowledge/                   # Knowledge base (verified patterns)
    |-- artifacts/                   # Plans, walkthroughs, eval reports, and task-local notes
```

### Folder Ownership

| Folder | Managed By | Purpose |
|--------|------------|---------|
| `testprogram/` | User + Agent | Test program source(s) (agent modifies with approval) |
| `.claude/rules/` | Maintainer | Active protocol and workflow rules |
| `.claude/skills/` | Maintainer | Skill/tool definitions |
| `.claude/knowledge/` | Maintainer | Verified knowledge patterns |
| `.claude/artifacts/` | Agent | Plans, walkthroughs, eval reports, and task-local notes |

**Important**: Users should ONLY edit `testprogram/`. Agent generates `.claude/artifacts/` and reads from `.claude/knowledge/` and `.claude/rules/`.

