## Improvement Loop

### What To Capture
- Corrections to agent behavior
- Missing workflow steps
- Platform-specific patterns
- Error resolutions
- User preferences

### What To Ignore
- General questions
- Status inquiries
- Casual conversation

### Core File Protection

**NEVER auto-modify**:
- `AGENTS.md`
- `README.md`
- `.claude/skills/**` (core skills)
- `.claude/rules/*.mdc` (protocol rules)
- `.claude/knowledge/*.md` (knowledge base)

All improvements require **human review** before integration.

