## Platform Support

### Advantest T2000 (OTPL)
```yaml
flows: [*.tpl, *.stpl, *.otpl]
limits: [*.ls]
bins: [*.bdefs]
code: [TestClasses/**/*.cpp]
```

### Advantest T2000 (RDK)
```yaml
flows: [*.tpl]
limits: [*.ls]
code: [TestFunctions/**/*.cpp]
```

### Advantest V93000 (SmarTest)
```yaml
flows: [*.tf]
limits: [*.txt, *.csv]
code: [testmethod/**/*.cpp]
```

### Teradyne Flex (IG-XL)
```yaml
flows: [*.igxl, *.vb]
limits: [*.txt]
code: [*.vb, *.vbs]
```

