## Model Selection (IDE-Dependent)

Different task focuses may benefit from different models:

| Task Focus | Recommended Model | Rationale |
|------------|-------------------|-----------|
| Planning / orchestration | Most capable (e.g., Claude Opus) | Complex reasoning |
| Implementation | Balanced (e.g., Claude Sonnet) | Code generation |
| Review / validation | Analytical model | Validation focus |

**Note**: In Cursor, use the Task tool's `model` parameter when available.

---

## Workspace Naming

The workspace folder may be renamed by users (e.g., `UQ29_relative_tests/` instead of `tp-agentkit/`). This does NOT affect agent operation - all paths are relative to workspace root.

